---
/** HTML version of the app's Ideas page (Northwind mock data): what needs a person first. */
import './mock.css';
---

<div class="mk ideas">
  <div class="mk-pad ideas-grid">
    <div class="ideas-main">
      <div class="ideas-head">
        <div>
          <p class="mk-h">Ideas</p>
          <p class="mk-sub">Things you want done. Start work on one when it’s ready.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="mk-btn">+ New idea</span>
      </div>
      <p class="ideas-search">Search ideas</p>

      <p class="mk-section">Needs you <span class="mk-count">3</span></p>
      <div class="need need--ask" data-ring>
        <p class="need-crumb"><span class="dot dot--amber">?</span>Retry failed webhook deliveries <span class="chev">›</span></p>
        <p class="need-title">Careful Builder asked you something</p>
        <p class="mk-sub">Stripe gives up after 3 days. Should we match that, or cap retries at 5 attempts?</p>
        <span class="mk-btn">Answer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="need need--fail">
        <p class="need-crumb"><span class="dot dot--red">!</span>Backfill the delivery index <span class="chev">›</span></p>
        <p class="need-title">Work stopped: pnpm test failed: 3 suites red in tests/unit/delivery</p>
        <p class="mk-sub">Backfilling the index stopped before it finished.</p>
        <p class="btns"><span class="mk-btn">See what happened</span><span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Try again…</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="need need--merged">
        <p class="need-crumb"><span class="dot dot--green"><svg class="mk-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.5" /><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2.5" /><path d="M6 8.5v13" /><path d="M11 6h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6.5" /></svg></span>Rate-limit the delivery log <span class="chev">›</span></p>
        <p class="need-title">PR #476 was merged 4 hours ago. Is this idea done?</p>
        <p class="btns"><span class="mk-btn">Mark done</span><span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Keep open</span></p>
      </div>

      <p class="mk-section">In progress <span class="mk-count">2</span></p>
      <ul class="rows mk-card">
        <li>
          <span class="mk-spin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span><b>Show every attempt in the dashboard</b><span class="mk-meta">Careful Builder is working in Adding the delivery log view</span></span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="pr" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="mk-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.5" /><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2.5" /><path d="M6 8.5v13" /><path d="M11 6h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6.5" /></svg></span>
          <span><b>Let merchants replay a parked event</b><span class="mk-meta">PR #491 is open, checks passed</span></span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <aside class="ideas-side mk-card">
      <p class="mk-section">Ideas move on their own</p>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="st">○</span>Not started until someone starts work</li>
        <li><span class="st">◌</span>In progress while a chat works on it</li>
        <li><span class="st st--violet"><svg class="mk-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.5" /><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2.5" /><path d="M6 8.5v13" /><path d="M11 6h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6.5" /></svg></span>In review when a pull request is open</li>
        <li><span class="st st--green">✓</span>Merged: you decide if it’s done</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ideas-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  @container (min-width: 620px) {
    .ideas-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 200px;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .ideas-side {
    display: none;
  }

  @container (min-width: 620px) {
    .ideas-side {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-top: 74px;
    }
  }

  .ideas-side ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 9px;
    font-size: 0.88em;
    color: var(--mk-muted);
  }

  .ideas-side li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .st {
    color: var(--mk-dim);
  }

  .st--violet {
    color: var(--mk-violet);
  }

  .st--green {
    color: var(--mk-green);
  }

  .ideas-main {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ideas-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ideas-search {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    color: var(--mk-dim);
    border: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
    background: var(--mk-surface);
  }

  .need {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    justify-items: start;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
  }

  .need--ask {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-amber) 9%, var(--mk-surface));
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-amber) 45%, transparent);
  }

  .need--fail {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-red) 8%, var(--mk-surface));
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-red) 40%, transparent);
  }

  .need--merged {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-green) 7%, var(--mk-surface));
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mk-green) 35%, transparent);
  }

  .need-crumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .chev {
    color: var(--mk-green);
  }

  .dot {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 15px;
    height: 15px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.75em;
    border: 1.5px solid currentColor;
  }

  .dot--amber {
    color: var(--mk-amber);
  }

  .dot--red {
    color: var(--mk-red);
  }

  .dot--green {
    color: var(--mk-green);
    border: 0;
  }

  .need-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05em;
  }

  .btns {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .rows li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 14px;
  }

  .rows li + li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
  }

  .rows li > span:last-child {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .pr {
    color: var(--mk-violet);
  }
</style>
